🚀 How to Run the Project

1. Clone the repository

git clone YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL

2. Open the SQL file

Open:

project medical data history 1.sql

in a MySQL-compatible SQL environment.

3. Select the database

Run:

USE project_medical_data_history;

4. Execute the queries

Run the queries individually to explore the patient, admission, doctor, and province data.

